  "basis": "The dashboard's y-axis is labeled 'Reported clean-grid share (%)', which is the metric for the routing decision. The bar heights are the authoritative encoding of this data. The Offshore wind bar is the tallest, reaching approximately 68 on the y-axis. The printed percentage labels are inconsistent with the axis scale (e.g., the Utility solar bar is labeled 41.2% but reaches the 40 tick, while the Offshore wind bar is labeled 29.8% but reaches ~68). Therefore, the largest contribution source is Offshore wind.",
  "option_label": "Route Offshore wind to priority contribution review"
}
